From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:08:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(render-android): bound sync-touch main-thread stall

Synchronous touch dispatch blocked the main thread on the context thread and
could ANR under load. Coalesce pending MOVE events (last wins) through a
ReplaceableTaskRegistry, report whether each bounded sync dispatch completed
in time, and let TouchSyncGuard downgrade the rest of a gesture to async
after a timeout so one slow frame cannot stall the whole gesture.

Fork-Patch: render-android-sync-touch-stall-guard
Origin: d8e2588f
